#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:7
#: 22508da1d32a4d9493161605c9e6fdc3
msgid ""
"Copter supports **Precision Landing** and **Precision Loiter**, which use"
" an external position reference (aka \"landing target\") to achieve "
"centimeter-level accuracy during landing or while hovering over a target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:9
#: 473f2f8f166546cd899ce83f1e64b36a
msgid ""
"Precision Landing is supported via MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ messages "
"sent from a companion computer such as the `Landmark system "
"<https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-precision-landing-"
"system>`__, or using the `IR-LOCK sensor <https://irlock.com/products/ir-"
"lock-sensor-precision-landing-kit>`__, `beacon "
"<https://irlock.com/products/markone-beacon-v3-0-beta>`__, and a "
":ref:`rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:14
#: efc8444b5a2c4658b65c73b4e501911d
msgid ""
"When the vehicle enters :ref:`Land mode <land-mode>` and a landing target"
" is detected, the target's position will be used to guide the final "
"descent. Precision Landing can also be performed in :ref:`RTL mode <rtl-"
"mode>` as the final stage of the return-to-launch sequence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:17
#: 509180e65b6e4f2d9c5e79d555ede603
msgid ""
"Precision Loiter requires minimal additional setup and is activated by "
"entering :ref:`Loiter mode <loiter-mode>` mode and invoking the Precision"
" Loiter :ref:`Auxiliary Function <common-auxiliary-functions>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:22
#: 1ef6d4c2b08d47c984ee762a9fc14984
msgid ""
"*This video demonstrates Precision Loiter followed by Precision Landing "
"using the Landmark Precision Landing System.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:26
#: f134ae09dd8c4315a2209189678aeef6
msgid "Available Systems"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:36
#: 1bafa7bba3a54a36abca563c64a64f53
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:38
#: 6e865dad73ee4dbdab9860352a63694c
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = **1** and reboot to expose "
"parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:39
#: 87eda246860e40b087f842d3fecfa2a4
msgid ""
"Select the landing target position source via :ref:`PLND_TYPE "
"<PLND_TYPE>` (e.g., **1** = MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__, **2** = "
"IR-LOCK, **3** = Gazebo Sim, **4** = SITL; **0** disables)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:40
#: 493825b301d4483488a65f63010e0fcf
msgid ""
"If the landing target camera/sensor is not pointing down or the x-axis is"
" not pointing forward, configure the mounting orientation using "
":ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>` and :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN "
"<PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:41
#: dc24cabe31034e49836fb8762e8b9a06
msgid ""
"Verify the target is detected while disarmed and the reported offsets "
"change as you move the target/vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:42
#: 54276a09154e4a9580bcc18106aec341
msgid "Take off and hover above the target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:43
#: fd21e818e9674e8fa12c6f75c320e6ea
msgid ""
"(Recommended) Confirm stable tracking in Precision Loiter before "
"attempting Precision Landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:44
#: e2d579f5de1a4b49b6e10b97f450c024
msgid "Activate :ref:`Land mode <land-mode>` to initiate Precision Landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:47
#: 05ae9f12b7b5438788d431ef06d93fcc
msgid ""
"Precision Landing requires a valid horizontal position estimate and a "
"steady attitude solution. Poor GPS/EKF or a noisy rangefinder will "
"degrade performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:51
#: d7a5f24c4e4248628ae841a317233f33
msgid "Operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:53
#: 99fa9285a9c544139720a8b3deb19153
msgid ""
"With Precision Landing enabled and Land mode activated, the external "
"landing target measurements override the target provided by the GPS "
"solution for the final approach."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:55
#: fd148fa2c5e64a1b810e017885ca9cd2
msgid ""
"If the landing target is not found, the vehicle will continue descending "
"vertically until the height specified by :ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX "
"<PLND_ALT_MAX>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:57
#: 0d5847b450e647339ff182842f28c5d6
msgid ""
"If the landing target is lost, the behaviour depends on :ref:`PLND_STRICT"
" <PLND_STRICT>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:59
#: ae563cbd0922428692932f172c0e7161
msgid "**0** – continue landing using standard Land mode logic (not strict)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:60
#: 43ce3db2066648109003c9cd3f0a80ce
msgid ""
"**1** – perform landing retries until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` "
"is reached, then land normally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:61
#: 25043f12f4c844e8b83dc72e7abd3efe
msgid ""
"**2** – perform landing retries until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` "
"is reached, then hover instead of landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:63
#: 1b5c6b25743d44a4a895d6699dbe221d
msgid ""
"When a landing retry is triggered, the vehicle will climb to a "
"height/position determined by :ref:`PLND_RET_BEHAVE <PLND_RET_BEHAVE>`. "
"It will then descend again in hopes of detecting the landing target. It "
"will keep doing this until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` retries "
"have occurred. Then, depending on :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`, the "
"vehicle will either just land, or it will stay in the air hovering "
"(useful for, say, landing on boats where you don’t want to land on "
"water)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:69
#: 175fa8e95a71451f82c2497aeb88404f
msgid ""
"If the landing target is lost below the height specified by "
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`, the vehicle will continue landing "
"vertically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:71
#: 57d828f2932b4a9bbcaeca24c467e751
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's EKF assumes the landing target is stationary. Set "
":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 0 if landing on a moving target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:73
#: 147bb8305cee4db580175fb886e65f55
msgid ""
"Repositioning manually by the pilot during the landing will abort the "
"landing unless :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (Allow Precision "
"Landing after manual reposition)is set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:75
#: 26a4ffd9835f446aba917501f659bfc9
msgid ""
"Final landing speed may be reduced below :ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>` "
"as necessary to assure a precise touchdown. This can be disabled for a "
"faster final land speed by setting :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit"
" 2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:81
#: b61033b6a83f4f3bacc3c342c4a9179e
msgid "*This video demonstrates the behaviour of different PLND_STRICT settings.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:85
#: 4cc622067c5149b584071b6db21a27a1
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:87
#: 816e648a79984ef0a9357331f0c2813c
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>`: Set to 1 to enable Precision Landing."
" Refresh parameters to see following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:88
#: b31cc1ff91594b38b32096d54cd53aa3
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>`: Sets the type of landing target position "
"source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:89
#: 2eeb0ead94bc4f73b350b10449ce16c6
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>` / :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN "
"<PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`: Sets the mounting orientation of the landing target "
"camera/sensor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:90
#: a025115fe2834b6594d83f82df7991fe
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_X <PLND_LAND_OFS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_Y "
"<PLND_LAND_OFS_Y>`: Sets the desired landing position of the "
"camera/sensor relative to the target. See :ref:`common-sensor-offset-"
"compensation` page for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:91
#: bd79b970fe3e4dcfb7c81a517bde7b6b
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Y>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`: Sets the "
"camera/sensor position relative to the vehicle body frame."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:92
#: 79dcc274ba004a3288c7f188f75b839f
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_XY_DIST_MAX <PLND_XY_DIST_MAX>`: Even if the landing target is"
" detected, the vehicle will not start descending if it is further than "
"this many meters away. Set to 0 to always descend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:93
#: 7e317e29d11047e9b622d6395f680ac5
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`: Controls the landing behaviour if the "
"target is lost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:94
#: dc49cc6f9f52424cb2a7485cc156ccfb
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`: If the target is lost below this "
"height, the vehicle will continue descending vertically. Set to 0 to "
"disable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:95
#: 319bdf27f2cb420b96ec089b00dcaff2
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`: If the target is not detected, the "
"vehicle will continue descending vertically until this height. Below this"
" height, if the target is still not found, the landing retry logic set by"
" :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>` will be applied. Set to 0 to disable "
"this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:96
#: 9d859478b07740f986c0305c2ec1f9e6
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>`: Set bit 0 if landing target is "
"moving, set bit 1 to allow the precision landing to continue after a "
"manual reposition, and set bit 2 to enable a faster final descent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:98
#: d4eba2c6e2544bfba8b2f6f3d936ddcd
msgid ""
"Additional ``PLND_`` parameters are listed in the `Complete Parameter "
"List <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#plnd-"
"parameters>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:102
#: abbb11ebb0a34f299c1fe79e20903373
msgid "Precision Loiter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:104
#: 8496f9f799a34cec99b3caa75feac2d7
msgid ""
"Precision Loiter uses the same backend and parameters as Precision "
"Landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:106
#: abd1e94db6c94b4397da24ab9cf4d3e4
msgid ""
"To enable Precision Loiter, set an :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switch "
"<common-auxiliary-functions>` to 39 (PrecLoiter Enable)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:108
#: e8d24bdec7e44f70b57fc665712ef6c0
msgid ""
"Entering Loiter mode and activating the switch will cause the vehicle to "
"hold its position above the target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:112
#: c71f3b6ecb9549d9b5d37cd78487836b
msgid "MAVLink LANDING_TARGET Message Based Systems"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:114
#: cf689065c3fc4d2d973ea35c0fcc81b6
msgid ""
"Using a companion computer, camera, and fiducial marker system such as "
"`AprilTag <https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/vision-"
"processing/apriltag/apriltag-intro.html>`__, the position differences to "
"the landing target location can be sent to the autopilot using MAVLink "
"`LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ messages. "
"Here is an example system description: `Precision Landing with Realsense "
"T265 Camera and AprilTag <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/precision-"
"landing-with-realsense-t265-camera-and-apriltag-part-1-2/48978>`__"
msgstr ""

